id: pm-jev-tl8w
title: "Daily release never publishes: npm reads release-artifact/package.tgz as a GitHub repository"
description: "The release job runs npm publish release-artifact/package.tgz. npm parses a bare dir/file.tgz spec as the GitHub shorthand owner/repo and runs git ls-remote ssh://git@github.com/release-artifact/package.tgz.git, which fails with Permission denied (publickey); after 3 attempts the job reports that nothing was published. Latest release run: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-jev/actions/runs/40672657971 (failure). Fix: publish ./release-artifact/package.tgz so npm reads the verified local archive."
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 0
tags[3]: ci,npm,release
created_at: "2026-10-28T15:20:41.183Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-28T15:25:33.874Z"
author: claude-hub
acceptance_criteria: release.yml publishes ./release-artifact/package.tgz; no other npm or bun command passes a bare relative tarball path; the next daily release publishes to npm with provenance
severity: high
comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-28T15:20:42.674Z",claude-hub,"Evidence: the failed release job log shows 'npm error command git --no-replace-objects ls-remote ssh://git@github.com/release-artifact/package.tgz.git' and 'git@github.com: Permission denied (publickey)' on each of the 3 attempts (same failure in pm-evidence, pm-hypothesis, pm-jev, pm-lint, pm-memory, pm-review, pm-rlm and pm-swarm, which all carry the scaffold line). The other uses of release-artifact/package.tgz in release.yml are shell arguments (mv, sha256sum, openssl), not npm package specs. Fleet tracking: unbraind/pm-cli-companion item pm-cli-website-l9y4."
  "2026-10-28T15:25:33.874Z",claude-hub,"The workflow contract test pinned the old bare spec; it now requires ./release-artifact/package.tgz and checks that every npm publish of a .tgz/.tar.gz names a local path (./, ../, / or a quoted variable). Focused test: pass 1; revert proof (bare spec restored in release.yml): fail 1."
files[2]{path,scope}:
  .github/workflows/release.yml,project
  test/release-workflow.test.ts,project
tests[1]{command,scope,provenance{author,created_at,source_kind,source_ref}}:
  node --test --test-name-pattern 'dependencies and repository scripts run only' test/release-workflow.test.ts,project,claude-hub,"2026-10-28T15:25:32.512Z",local_mutation,fix/release-publish-local-tarball
body: ""
